    "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 spec for the Meridian Transit Cloud \u2014 a SaaS API for regional public-transit agencies to publish real-time vehicle positions, trip updates, and rider-facing alerts. API, inlined below. All endpoints are relative paths on the same host; construct requests with execute().",
